This repository bundles or builds on several open-source projects, each used
under their original permissive licenses (all MIT). Full attributions:

* LitePT — © 2025 Photogrammetry and Remote Sensing Lab (MIT).
  Reused in `models/litept/` verbatim.

* pyLitePT — © 2025 Photogrammetry and Remote Sensing Lab (MIT).
  Reused in `pcdet_lite/`, `models/detection.py`, `models/modules.py`,
  `backend_cpu/`, `libs/`, `metrics/`, `utils/`, `hybrid_backend.py`, and
  adapted in `models/unified.py`, `data/labeled_dataset.py`.

* Point-JEPA — © 2023 Karim Abou Zeid (MIT).
  SSL recipe reference. `jepa/ema.py` adapted from Point-JEPA's `EMA.py`.

* labelCloud — bundled under `labelCloud/`, integrated under MIT for this
  repository by arrangement with the upstream maintainer (Christoph Sager,
  github.com/ch-sa/labelCloud). The labelCloud subdirectory's own LICENSE
  documents this.
